<</A 664 0 R/ActualText(Comparison of image processing methods for tomato detection. The top row \(labeled A-D\) shows tomatoes on vines with varying color changes under different algorithms. The bottom row \(labeled GT, ORCNN, AISFormer, Ours\) shows tomatoes highlighted with bounding boxes, displaying varying levels of ripeness and detection accuracy. Each method depicts different levels of detail and color fidelity in processing tomato images.)/Alt(Comparison of image processing methods for tomato detection. The top row \(labeled A-D\) shows tomatoes on vines with varying color changes under different algorithms. The bottom row \(labeled GT, ORCNN, AISFormer, Ours\) shows tomatoes highlighted with bounding boxes, displaying varying levels of ripeness and detection accuracy. Each method depicts different levels of detail and color fidelity in processing tomato images.)/K 1/P 646 0 R/Pg 120 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
